    "image_path": "images/slide_02.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "特别的你\n作者: 尼古拉·康纳利、安妮·怀特\n\nText copyright © 2018 Nicola Connelly\nIllustrations copyright © 2018 Annie White\nFirst published in Australia 2018 by New Frontier Publishing Pty Ltd\nTranslations rights arranged through Australian Licensing Corporation\n\nTigerlee独家更新：hitiger.taobao.com\n2/20",
    "page_text_en": "Special You\nAuthor: Nicola Connelly, Annie White\n\nText copyright © 2018 Nicola Connelly\nIllustrations copyright © 2018 Annie White\nFirst published in Australia 2018 by New Frontier Publishing Pty Ltd\nTranslations rights arranged through Australian Licensing Corporation\n\nTigerlee exclusive update: hitiger.taobao.com\n2/20",
    "summary_zh": "本页为绘本《特别的你》的扉页，左侧显示书名和作者信息，右侧为一个穿着波点背带裤、戴着绿色帽子、手持彩旗的快乐小男孩插图，画面充满童趣和活力。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "特别的你",
    "title_en": "Special You",
    "target_age": "3-7",
    "source_type": "pptx",
    "source_file": "特别的你(3-7 岁).pptx",
    "page_index_in_story": 3,
    "source_page": 3,
    "image_path": "images/slide_03.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "是什么让你与众不同？\n是眼睛的颜色吗？\n\n是皮肤的颜色吗？\n是脸上的小雀斑吗？\n还是尖尖的小下巴？",
    "page_text_en": "What makes you different?\nIs it the color of your eyes?\n\nIs it the color of your skin?\nIs it the freckles on your face?\nOr is it your pointy little chin?",
    "summary_zh": "本页通过文字提问，引导读者思考自己与众不同的外貌特征，如眼睛颜色、皮肤颜色、雀斑或下巴形状，画面展示了四个穿着奇装异服、表情各异的儿童，呼应主题。"
  },
  {
